[SE00006] 🤡 LITERALLY WRONG [Line 1]: d"2024-02-30" is not a real date: February 2024 has no day 30.
  --> bad_date_literals.splat:1:6
   |
 1 | x := d"2024-02-30"
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: Write dates as d"yyyy-MM-dd".

[SE00006] 🤡 LITERALLY WRONG [Line 2]: tm"25:00:00" is not a real time of day: there is no hour 25 on a 24-hour clock.
  --> bad_date_literals.splat:2:6
   |
 2 | y := tm"25:00:00"
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: Write times as tm"HH:mm:ss" on a 24-hour clock.

[SE00006] 🤡 LITERALLY WRONG [Line 3]: t"2024-13-01T00:00:00Z" is not a real timestamp: there is no month 13.
  --> bad_date_literals.splat:3:6
   |
 3 | z := t"2024-13-01T00:00:00Z"
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  Fix: Write timestamps as t"yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ".

[SE00006] 🤡 LITERALLY WRONG [Line 4]: d"2024-1-1" is not a real date: a date is written yyyy-MM-dd, like d"2024-03-01".
  --> bad_date_literals.splat:4:6
   |
